  "verbalization": "Yuanhuapine appears to have a target relationship with Carboxylesterase 2 through multiple pathways, all of which involve the compound SNU-387. The evidence suggests that Yuanhuapine acts on SNU-387, which is then targeted by Carboxylesterase 2. This indicates a potential mechanism where Yuanhuapine may influence the activity of SNU-387, which in turn is a target of Carboxylesterase 2. The presence of multiple distinct molecular structures that are targets of Carboxylesterase 2 further supports the idea that Yuanhuapine may interact with these targets through a common pathway, possibly by modulating their activity or enhancing their enzymatic function. The integration of these pathways highlights the possibility that Yuanhuapine exerts its effects by interacting with Carboxylesterase 2 through a mechanism that involves SNU-387 as a mediator.",
